Kubernetes in plain English.
 * Pods -> for running apps.
 * Deployments -> for replacing pods.
 * Services -> for finding pods.
 * Ingress -> for letting traffic in.
 * ConfigMaps -> for settings.
 * Secrets -> for base64 confidence.
 * Helm -> for generating YAML.
 * Kustomize -> for patching YAML.
 * HPA -> for scaling pods.
 * KEDA -> for scaling on events.
 * operators -> for automating experts.
 * kubectl -> for 3 AM.
 * Kubernetes -> for distributed problems.
